# =============================================================================
# Turok: Dinosaur Hunter — PC/3DS port (source only)
#
# This repo contains ONLY the port source: the original game engine
# (src/PR/tengine), the platform layer (port/), the vendored libultra
# (lib/ultralib), and the build/docs tooling.
#
# Copyrighted game data is NOT committed — supply your own locally:
#   * baserom.us.v12.z64   (retail US v1.2 ROM)
#   * src/PR/cartdata.dat  (cartridge asset blob)
# =============================================================================

# --- Copyrighted ROMs / cartridge / asset blobs ---
*.z64
*.n64
*.v64
*.N64
*.V64
*.dat
*.bin

